# Is any value consumed at or before the position of the node that produces it?
# If not, the node order of each graph is a topological order, so the graph has no cycle.
#
# The patterns are in this order on purpose. Oxigraph joins them as written:
# pairing consumer and producer through the value first is linear in the number
# of nodes; pairing them through the graph first is quadratic. Seen in a probe
# on a development machine with synthetic chains (3.2 s against 0.01 s at 2,000
# nodes); not yet measured in CI.
PREFIX lmnf: <https://metavacua.github.io/lm-normal-form/ns#>
ASK {
  ?consumer lmnf:consumes ?value .
  ?producer lmnf:produces ?value .
  ?consumer lmnf:inGraph ?graph ; lmnf:index ?i .
  ?producer lmnf:inGraph ?graph ; lmnf:index ?j .
  FILTER(?j >= ?i)
}
